{"id":"9d935e48-485a-40b4-ae48-fd469f9cf819","createdAt":"2026-10-25T05:19:34.697Z","batchId":"login_glm-5-3-flash-opencode-go_high","approach":"html","modelId":"glm-5.3-flash-opencode-go","settings":{"effort":"high"},"presetId":"login","prompt":"A login form with email, password, a \"remember me\" option and a sign-in button.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<div class=\"page center\" style=\"min-height:100vh;justify-content:center\">\n  <div class=\"stack gap-lg\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:400px\">\n\n    <div class=\"stack gap-sm center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n      <div class=\"avatar center\" style=\"width:48px;height:48px;font-weight:700;margin:0 auto;background:var(--accent,#6366f1);color:#fff\">AC</div>\n      <h1 style=\"margin:0\">Welcome back</h1>\n      <p class=\"muted\" style=\"margin:0\">Sign in to your Acme Cloud workspace to continue.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"card stack gap-lg\">\n      <div class=\"alert alert-destructive stack gap-sm\" id=\"form-error\" hidden>\n        <strong>Sign-in failed</strong>\n        <span class=\"small\" id=\"form-error-msg\">Please check your credentials and try again.</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <form class=\"stack gap-lg\" id=\"login-form\" novalidate>\n        <label class=\"stack gap-sm\" style=\"align-items:stretch\">\n          <span class=\"small\" style=\"font-weight:600\">Email address</span>\n          <input type=\"email\" id=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@company.com\" autocomplete=\"email\" required>\n        </label>\n\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <div class=\"row between\" style=\"align-items:center\">\n            <span class=\"small\" style=\"font-weight:600\">Password</span>\n            <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\" id=\"forgot-btn\">Forgot password?</button>\n          </div>\n          <label style=\"align-items: stretch; gap: 0.5rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column\">\n            <input type=\"password\" id=\"password\" placeholder=\"Enter your password\" autocomplete=\"current-password\" required>\n          </label>\n          <span class=\"small muted\" id=\"pw-hint\">Minimum 8 characters.</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"row between\" style=\"align-items:center\">\n          <label class=\"check\" style=\"gap:0.5rem\">\n            <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"remember\" checked>\n            <span>Remember me for 30 days</span>\n          </label>\n          <span class=\"badge badge-outline small\" id=\"device-badge\">Trusted device</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-block btn-lg\" id=\"submit-btn\">Sign in</button>\n      </form>\n\n      <div class=\"hr\"></div>\n\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <p class=\"small muted\" style=\"margin:0;text-align:center\">New to Acme Cloud? <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\" id=\"request-btn\">Request access</button></p>\n        <p class=\"small muted\" style=\"margin:0;text-align:center\">Protected by SSO &amp; two-factor authentication. <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">SOC 2</span></p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"small muted center\" style=\"text-align:center;margin:0\">Demo credentials: <strong>demo@acme.cloud</strong> / <strong>hunter22</strong></p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function () {\n  var form = document.getElementById('login-form');\n  var errBox = document.getElementById('form-error');\n  var errMsg = document.getElementById('form-error-msg');\n  var submit = document.getElementById('submit-btn');\n  var email = document.getElementById('email');\n  var password = document.getElementById('password');\n  var hint = document.getElementById('pw-hint');\n  var remember = document.getElementById('remember');\n  var badge = document.getElementById('device-badge');\n\n  function showError(msg) {\n    errMsg.textContent = msg;\n    errBox.hidden = false;\n  }\n\n  password.addEventListener('input', function () {\n    hint.textContent = password.value.length >= 8\n      ? 'Looks good — ' + password.value.length + ' characters.'\n      : 'Minimum 8 characters. Currently ' + password.value.length + '.';\n  });\n\n  remember.addEventListener('change', function () {\n    badge.textContent = remember.checked ? 'Trusted device · 30 days' : 'Session only';\n  });\n\n  form.addEventListener('submit', function (e) {\n    e.preventDefault();\n    errBox.hidden = true;\n    if (!email.value || email.value.indexOf('@') < 1) {\n      showError('Enter a valid email address.');\n      email.focus();\n      return;\n    }\n    if (password.value.length < 8) {\n      showError('Your password must be at least 8 characters.');\n      password.focus();\n      return;\n    }\n    submit.disabled = true;\n    submit.textContent = 'Signing in…';\n    setTimeout(function () {\n      if (email.value.trim().toLowerCase() === 'demo@acme.cloud' && password.value === 'hunter22') {\n        submit.textContent = 'Signed in ✓';\n        submit.classList.add('btn-secondary');\n      } else {\n        submit.disabled = false;\n        submit.textContent = 'Sign in';\n        showError('Incorrect email or password. Try the demo credentials below.');\n      }\n    }, 700);\n  });\n\n  document.getElementById('forgot-btn').addEventListener('click', function () {\n    errBox.hidden = false;\n    errBox.querySelector('strong').textContent = 'Password reset';\n    errMsg.textContent = 'Enter your email above and we will send reset instructions (demo only).';\n  });\n\n  document.getElementById('request-btn').add